# my_engine: P1 and P2 swept through their range under a chord, a pitch bend, then every knob at 0 and at 255.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 2.0
track chord
preset 0 0 10 80 220 60 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 128 100 255 0 0
sweep p1 0 255 0 16
sweep p2 0 255 0 16
note 0 C3 14 90
note 0 E3 14 90
note 0 G3 14 90
note 0 B3 14 90
bend 6 200
bend 10 -200
bend 14 0
preset 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 128 100 255 0 0
param p1 255 16
param p2 255 16
param attack 255 24
param release 0 24
note 16 C1 6 127
note 24 G8 6 127
expect sound 0 14
expect sound 16 22
expect idle 46
